  _bodyField: {fileID: 390155248}
  _title: 
  _body: 'After the war, cryptography left the battlefield for the bank, the browser
    and the phone. It also faced an old paradox: how can two strangers agree on a
    secret key while an eavesdropper listens to every word? The answer rebuilt the
    world. Recover the passphrase from the Enigma, TSANLC, and open the vault.'
  _group: {fileID: 0}
  _revealRadius: 14
  _fullRadius: 7
