  _titleField: {fileID: 0}
  _bodyField: {fileID: 493976358}
  _title: 
  _body: 'Mathematician Peter Shor proved that a large enough quantum computer could
    factor huge numbers with ease, quietly dissolving the hard problem that RSA and
    much of today''s encryption rely upon.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b>  The reason
    the whole world is now racing to upgrade its cryptography before such a machine
    is built.'
  _group: {fileID: 0}
  _revealRadius: 14
  _fullRadius: 7
