  _bodyField: {fileID: 920894376}
  _title: 
  _body: 'Rejewski''s electro-mechanical ''bomba'' searched Enigma settings automatically.
    At Bletchley Park, Alan Turing and Gordon Welchman rebuilt the idea as the Bombe,
    ranks of spinning drums testing thousands of wirings an hour.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b> 
    Machines built to defeat machines, the first great triumph of automated codebreaking.'
  _group: {fileID: 0}
  _revealRadius: 14
  _fullRadius: 7
