  _titleField: {fileID: 0}
  _bodyField: {fileID: 1366554196}
  _title: 
  _body: 'In a Victorian mansion north of London, nearly ten thousand people, two-thirds
    of them women, intercepted, sorted and broke Axis ciphers around the clock, sworn
    to a silence many kept for the rest of their lives.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b> 
    Historians credit the work here with shortening the war by up to two years and
    saving countless lives.'
  _group: {fileID: 0}
  _revealRadius: 14
  _fullRadius: 7
