  _bodyField: {fileID: 1450026874}
  _title: 
  _body: 'Gilbert Vernam and Joseph Mauborgne combined each letter with a key of
    pure random characters, used exactly once and never repeated. Decades later Claude
    Shannon proved it mathematically unbreakable.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b>

    The
    only cipher in history proven to offer perfect secrecy, at the brutal cost of
    a key as long as every message you will ever send.'
