  _title: 
  _body: 'Run public-key cryptography in reverse and you can sign instead of hide:
    only your private key could have produced the mark, but anyone with your public
    key can verify it. The signature breaks if the document is altered.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b> 
    Proof of who sent a message and that no one changed it, the backbone of software
    updates, contracts and digital identity.'
