  _bodyField: {fileID: 1945990527}
  _title: 
  _body: 'Encryption is no longer only a tool of generals and spies. It protects
    the journalist''s source, the dissident''s plea, the ordinary person''s ordinary
    life. Every secret you keep relies on an unbroken chain that began with a Spartan
    staff.


    <b>SIGNIFICANCE</b>  Cryptology is, in the end, about freedom: the
    human right to think, speak and trust in private.'
  _group: {fileID: 0}
